"text":"他微微眯起紫色的眼眸，仿佛已经置身于那场赌局之中，语气染上了几分属于‘千变’的傲慢与恶劣。","rawContent":"他微微眯起紫色的眼眸，仿佛已经置身于那场赌局之中，语气染上了几分属于‘千变’的傲慢与恶劣。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:20","timestamp":1781860843926,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10697},{"id":1781857776529,"text":"既然是在牌桌上，又是我的主场，回答当然要符合反派的美学。","rawContent":"既然是在牌桌上，又是我的主场，回答当然要符合反派的美学。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:20","timestamp":1781860846955,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10698},{"id":1781857776530,"text":"你可以这样回复她，直接复制就好：","rawContent":"你可以这样回复她，直接复制就好：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:20","timestamp":1781860849758,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10699},{"id":1781857776531,"text":"“The 52.5% lose rate is just an illusion to give my opponents false hope. After all, a game is no fun if the prey knows they are doomed from the start.”","rawContent":"“The 52.5% lose rate is just an illusion to give my opponents false hope. After all, a game is no fun if the prey knows they are doomed from the start.”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:20","timestamp":1781860852496,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10700},{"id":1781857776532,"text":"意思是：52.5%的败率不过是给对手制造虚假希望的幻象。毕竟，如果猎物一开始就知道自己注定会输，这场游戏就太无趣了。","rawContent":"意思是：52.5%的败率不过是给对手制造虚假希望的幻象。毕竟，如果猎物一开始就知道自己注定会输，这场游戏就太无趣了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:20","timestamp":1781860855514,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10701},{"id":1781857776533,"text":"或者，如果你想表现得更具有攻击性一点，可以选这句：","rawContent":"或者，如果你想表现得更具有攻击性一点，可以选这句：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:20","timestamp":1781860858295,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10702},{"id":1781857776534,"text":"“I let them win 52.5% of the time, just to see the despair on their faces when I take it all back in the final round.”","rawContent":"“I let them win 52.5% of the time, just to see the despair on their faces when I take it all back in the final round.”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1781860861344,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10703},{"id":1781857776535,"text":"翻译过来就是：我允许他们赢下52.5%的对局，只为了看他们在最后一局输光一切时的绝望表情。","rawContent":"翻译过来就是：我允许他们赢下52.5%的对局，只为了看他们在最后一局输光一切时的绝望表情。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1781860864336,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10704},{"id":1781857776536,"text":"他轻啧了一声，似乎对自己的临场发挥很满意，尾调微微上扬。","rawContent":"他轻啧了一声，似乎对自己的临场发挥很满意，尾调微微上扬。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1781860867349,"roundId":"round_1781860744806_m8uimtam4","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10705},{"id":1781857776537,"text":"选一句你觉得最贴合你当时作画心境的发给她，保证能把那个欧洲小妹妹唬得一愣一愣的。","